<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines exports rise in first four months.</title>
<headline>Philippines exports rise in first four months.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine merchandise exports rose to $7.588 billion in the first four months of the year, against $6.177 billion in the same period last year, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Exports in April alone rose to $2.082 billion from $1.492 billion.</p>
</text>
